01:02:39.850 --> 01:02:49.270
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Thanks, as always, to my boss, Ira Glass. He's out this week, but he called just to remind everyone that dressing up for Halloween is optional at our office.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>像往常一样感谢我的老板，Ira Glass。他这周不在，但他打电话提醒大家万圣节装扮在我们办公室是可选的。

01:02:49.270 --> 01:02:54.710
<v Police Officer>I'm not going to force anybody. I'm not putting masks on anybody. That's not my job.
<v Police Officer>我不会强迫任何人。我不会给任何人戴口罩。那不是我的工作。

01:02:54.710 --> 01:02:59.710
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>I'm Chana Joffe-Walt. We'll be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>我是Chana Joffe-Walt。我们下周会带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。
